 "notes": "Web vs app subnets are distinguished only by tags/names in the GT, so the interface endpoints are checked against subnets generally (at least two each). The S3 policy check binds Allow, any principal and a read action to one statement; extra write actions are not rejected because the prompt does not say read-only. out_count requires six outputs; a single joined subnet-list output would fail it (detail, kept)."
